  "scope": "IndexSDK-aligned BM25 package. Huge-first allocation fix passed real A5 host/device and MS MARCO checks. Subsequent SciFact/TREC-COVID repeats reproduce prior role-specific quality; observed NPU median changes are -0.49% to +0.78%, median-of-round-P95 changes -0.40% to +1.40%. SciFact A still fails the native-CPU median win gate; other real cases retain their reported gates. Original-native BM25S, mixed small-corpus timing, cross-session limits and the MS MARCO slower first round remain explicit. Archive-only update; implementation unchanged. Retained 8192-document synthetic input also checked: NPU medians are 17.03%/14.41% below historical session, with six median/P95 wins against original native BM25S; real-input stage attribution remains unprofiled. Isolated 1024/2048/4096 capacity tools are locally checked; all experimental CANN builds/device timings remain pending and default capacity is unchanged.",
